==Trivia==
* In the early days of ''[[RuneScape 2]]'', this bar was the location of [[Dr Harlow]], an important character in the [[Vampyre Slayer]] quest. He was moved to the [[Blue Moon Inn]] because newer players had a hard time finding the bar and would often wander into the nearby Wilderness.
* When asking the [[Bartender (Jolly Boar Inn)|bartender]] for gossip, he will say that the [[Bartender (Blue Moon Inn)|bartender]] of the [[Blue Moon Inn]] is crazy because he thinks ''Old School RuneScape'' is in a computer game, referencing that bartender's dialogue when you ask him how to make money.

